From 1489c237d855900f82f69ca19830d2c61eb8ee5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 18:06:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wasm: framebuffer (wasmfb) and keyboard/pointer (wasminput)
 drivers

wasmfb: XRGB8888 fbdev in kernel memory that the host blits to the page's
canvas every frame; direct mmap on !MMU via get_unmapped_area; mode from
wasmfb.mode=WxH.  wasminput: a keyboard and an absolute pointer fed from
a shared event ring and WASM_IRQ_INPUT.  defconfig: FB, fbcon (VT),
evdev.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/wasm/configs/wasm_defconfig |  11 +-
 arch/wasm/drivers/Kconfig        |  16 +++
 arch/wasm/drivers/Makefile       |   2 +
 arch/wasm/drivers/wasmfb.c       | 176 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 arch/wasm/drivers/wasminput.c    | 130 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 333 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/wasm/drivers/wasmfb.c
 create mode 100644 arch/wasm/drivers/wasminput.c

